      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s an unclear choice - some older SVE micro-architectures prefer `add` but more modern micro-architectures (both big and little) seem to slightly prefer the `incb`, in practice it doesn\u0027t really make a meaningful difference though.\n\nLeaving this as-is because it most closely matches what we do elsewhere in the file?",
      "parentUuid": "dbdb7ffa_6c935328",
      "revId": "a52a53367771a8b6c81b8737dcc991b4ff8cea43",
